# WiX's local extension cache (downloaded binaries, not source —
# restored automatically via NuGet when the .wixproj's PackageReference
# is resolved; committing it would put a binary DLL in git for no
# reason, confirmed by actually running `wix extension add` locally
# and seeing exactly this land here).
installer/wix/.wix/

